{"unit_id":"tag:06YN:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。复形（complex）<MATH_0002> 由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成，称其为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>K-平坦（K-flat）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果对每个无上同调（acyclic）的复形（complex）<MATH_0004>（由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成），复形（complex）\n<MATH_0006>\n都无上同调（acyclic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"模复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数环上的模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"定义的复形性质"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调","context":"复形上同调消失"}],"notes":[]}
